cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Chunking verdicts under count- and budget-matched retrieval: code, analysis plans and results"
abstract: >-
  Code, written analysis plans, deviation logs, run manifests, per-query results and analyses for a multiverse
  analysis of how the retrieval-selection protocol (a fixed number of chunks vs a fixed word budget) changes chunking
  verdicts in retrieval-augmented generation, with an extension to semantic chunking and dense retrieval, an
  exploratory answer-quality check (per-row metric values) and a provisional, single-coded protocol audit of recent
  chunking studies. The source datasets are not included; a fetch script downloads them and checks their digests.
  The original version history is not available, so the timing of the analysis plans cannot be independently
  verified.
authors:
  - family-names: "Chand J C"
    given-names: "Swaroop"
license:
